      en: ["Built in 1572, making it one of the oldest churches in the region.", "Houses the 'Christ of the Mercies', a 16th-century gift from Spain.", "Features intricate Baroque altarpieces covered in authentic gold leaf.", "The church is the center of one of Honduras' oldest mining towns.", "The annual festival of Saint Lucia is celebrated every December 13th.", "The site is a major cultural landmark within the Francisco Morazán department."],
