      en: ["Officially named Luis Alonso Baraona Park in honor of a local figure.", "Situated directly in front of the San Pedro Apóstol Cathedral.", "Serves as the zero kilometer point for San Pedro Sula's street grid.", "The park is the main stage for the city's annual 'Feria Juniana' festival.", "Features a classic early 20th-century wrought-iron gazebo.", "Surrounded by historic buildings including the Municipal Palace."],
